  "question": {
    "text": "Line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
